      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">غَمِيمٌ</span></b>  <i>i. q.</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">غَمِيسٌ</span>, (S, K,) i. e. <i>Fresh herbage</i>
(<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">كَلَأٌ</span>) <i>beneath such as is dried up;</i> (S, TA;) or
<i>green herbage beneath such as is dry.</i> (TA.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2- 
